<p class="pv-upd">Last updated 12 November 2026</p>

<h2>Who we are</h2>
<p>Brightyard runs brightyard.in and decides how the data described here is used. For anything about your data, email <a class="ul-link" href="mailto:hello@brightyard.in">hello@brightyard.in</a>.</p>

<h2>What we collect, and why</h2>
<div class="pv-t" role="region" aria-label="What we collect" tabindex="0"><table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">When you…</th><th scope="col">We receive</th><th scope="col">We use it to</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td data-l="When you…">Type a brief into Brief to blueprint</td><td data-l="We receive">Nothing. The blueprint is drawn in your browser.</td><td data-l="We use it to">-</td></tr>
<tr><td data-l="When you…">Ask us to email your blueprint</td><td data-l="We receive">Your email address, your brief and the start date you picked</td><td data-l="We use it to">Send you the blueprint. We may follow up once.</td></tr>
<tr><td data-l="When you…">Ask an engineer to check it</td><td data-l="We receive">The above, plus your name, company, role and when you'd start</td><td data-l="We use it to">Review your blueprint and reply within one business day</td></tr>
<tr><td data-l="When you…">Send a contact or product form</td><td data-l="We receive">What you enter in the form</td><td data-l="We use it to">Reply to you</td></tr>
<tr><td data-l="When you…">Open the 3D blueprint</td><td data-l="We receive">A daily count of steps such as "chapter 2 viewed". No cookies, IP addresses or visitor IDs.</td><td data-l="We use it to">See which parts of the blueprint are useful</td></tr>
<tr><td data-l="When you…">Send any form</td><td data-l="We receive">A scrambled form of your network address that changes every hour</td><td data-l="We use it to">Stop spam floods. We delete it within a day.</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<p>We rely on your consent, which you give by sending the form. You can withdraw it at any time by emailing us; we then stop and delete your details.</p>

<h2>Who else handles it</h2>
<ul class="pv-l">
<li><b>Cloudflare</b> hosts this site and the database that stores your requests, and sees network addresses to deliver and protect the site.</li>
<li><b>Zoho</b> sends our emails (ZeptoMail) and hosts our inbox (Zoho Mail).</li>
</ul>
<p>These providers may process data in India and other countries. They act on our instructions and may not use your data for their own purposes. We share nothing with anyone else unless the law requires it.</p>

<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
<ul class="pv-l">
<li>Blueprint and form requests: 12 months, then deleted automatically. If you become a client, we keep what the contract needs.</li>
<li>Scrambled network addresses used against spam: deleted within a day.</li>
<li>Daily counts contain no personal data, so we keep them.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Cookies and storage</h2>
<p>We don't use tracking or advertising cookies. The site remembers for the current browser tab that you've seen its welcome hint; closing the tab clears it.</p>

<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You can ask us to show you what we hold about you, correct it, delete it, or stop using it, and you can name someone to act for you. Email <a class="ul-link" href="mailto:hello@brightyard.in">hello@brightyard.in</a>. We confirm within one business day and act within 30 days. If you're not satisfied with our answer, you can complain to the Data Protection Board of India, or to the data protection authority where you live.</p>

<h2>Children</h2>
<p>This site is for businesses. We don't knowingly collect data from anyone under 18.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>If we change how we use your data, we'll update this page and the date at the top.</p>
</div></div></div>
